## 8.1 Institution Management

Support the following hierarchy:

Institution → Campus → Department → Programme → Academic Year → Semester → Section → Subject.

The system should support future expansion to additional campuses without redesigning the core database.

## 8.2 Student Management

Store:

- Registration number.
- Name.
- Institutional email.
- Department.
- Programme.
- Batch.
- Current year.
- Current semester.
- Section.
- Academic status.
- Approved profile details.

Avoid collecting unnecessary personal information.

Provide controlled bulk import using validated CSV or Excel files.

## 8.3 Faculty Management

Store:

- Faculty ID.
- Name.
- Institutional email.
- Department.
- Designation.
- Assigned subjects.
- Assigned sections.
- Employment status.

Allow administrators to assign and remove faculty allocations.

## 8.4 Subject and Course Management

