- Deployment rollback procedure.

Suggested initial service targets:

| Area | Initial target |
|---|---|
| Availability | 99.5% monthly MVP target |
| Common API operations | Typically under 2 seconds under expected load |
| Accessibility | Target WCAG 2.2 AA |
| Data backups | Automated and monitored |
| Recovery | Documented and tested RPO/RTO |
